<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Christmas Day (Gustav Holst)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1910</span><span class="sg-chain-h">used in a choral fantasy</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Carol Symphony (Victor Hely-Hutchinson)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1927</span><span class="sg-chain-h">scherzo on the tune</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">A Christmas Carol (Charles Dickens)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1843</span><span class="sg-chain-h">quoted in a novella</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Silas Marner (George Eliot)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1861</span><span class="sg-chain-h">quoted in a novel</span></li></ul></section>
